# The image's own entries for the decoy key (DECOY in /etc/amethystora/security.conf): the programs that read
# every file of a home, and so the decoy too. The machine's own are in /etc/amethystora/allow.d/decoy
# (ame security allow decoy PROGRAM). A glob each.
#
# The backup, the virus scans and the file indexer
/usr/bin/restic
/usr/bin/clamscan
/usr/bin/clamdscan
/usr/libexec/localsearch-*
